  "description": "02. Remove Background with Sam3 is a cleanup & background workflow designed to isolate the subject or remove unwanted image content using the models configured in the graph. Its 5-node graph exposes 0 prompt/text field(s), 1 media input target(s), and 2 save/preview stage(s), while preserving the original editor-format graph for reference. The imported graph contains unresolved custom-node classes, so install or map the listed nodes and reconvert from the included editor graph before production use.",
